WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.503 --> 00:00:13.283
could not sleep.

2
00:00:14.003 --> 00:00:18.084
He kept thinking of the money tree and the wonderful presents he would buy.

3
00:00:18.104 --> 00:00:22.925
"Oh, I can't wait to see my money tree," he said.

4
00:00:23.846 --> 00:00:24.926
But, he could not leave.

5
00:00:24.946 --> 00:00:32.128
"You must wait for sunlight before you go to the field," the cat had said.

6
00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:40.893
"Yes, if you see the field before sunlight, the magic tree will die," the fox had agreed.

7
00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:44.916
So Pinocchio waited and waited.

8
00:00:47.277 --> 00:00:51.921
As soon as the sun came up, Pinocchio ran all the way to the Field of Follies.

9
00:00:52.521 --> 00:00:53.602
He didn't stop once.

10
00:00:54.803 --> 00:01:00.086
"Here is the field," Pinocchio said, "but, where is my money tree?"

11
00:01:01.607 --> 00:01:05.149
He looked all over the field, but saw nothing that looked like a money tree.

12
00:01:05.169 --> 00:01:09.191
"I know this is the right field," he said, puzzled.

13
00:01:09.211 --> 00:01:12.232
"Maybe the gold forgot to grow!

14
00:01:13.152 --> 00:01:14.093
I will dig it out."

15
00:01:15.953 --> 00:01:18.194
So Pinocchio got down and began to dig.

16
00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:21.476
He dug and dug until he was covered in dirt.

17
00:01:22.436 --> 00:01:25.097
This hole was five times as big as the first hole.

18
00:01:25.898 --> 00:01:27.098
But he saw no gold!

19
00:01:27.118 --> 00:01:30.319
"I know this is the right place!

20
00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:33.101
Oh! Where is my gold?"

21
00:01:33.822 --> 00:01:34.662
Pinocchio cried.

22
00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:38.124
Above his head, someone was laughing.

23
00:01:38.805 --> 00:01:40.446
Pinocchio looked up and saw Mr.

24
00:01:40.486 --> 00:01:43.568
Cricket. "What are you doing here?"

25
00:01:44.068 --> 00:01:44.989
Pinocchio shouted.

26
00:01:45.009 --> 00:01:47.371
"And why are you laughing at me?"

27
00:01:47.391 --> 00:01:52.634
"You are a foolish boy, Pinocchio," Mr.

28
00:01:52.694 --> 00:01:53.535
Cricket replied.

29
00:01:53.555 --> 00:01:58.018
"I tried to warn you about bad friends and bad choices.

30
00:01:58.838 --> 00:02:00.620
But you didn't listen to me.

31
00:02:01.464 --> 00:02:04.066
The fox and cat have stolen your gold.

32
00:02:04.606 --> 00:02:06.867
They are very far away by now."

33
00:02:06.887 --> 00:02:08.828
"Oh no!

34
00:02:09.649 --> 00:02:10.569
Oh no!"

35
00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:12.290
Pinocchio said.

36
00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.711
He sat in the dirt and cried.

37
00:02:14.731 --> 00:02:18.473
"I must tell the police.

38
00:02:19.054 --> 00:02:20.174
They will help me."

39
00:02:21.915 --> 00:02:25.357
So Pinocchio ran off to the nearest town and went to the jail.

40
00:02:26.037 --> 00:02:27.698
He told the police his story.

41
00:02:28.339 --> 00:02:30.440
But, they did not help Pinocchio find his gold.

42
00:02:31.008 --> 00:02:31.988
They locked him in prison!

43
00:02:32.008 --> 00:02:36.730
"Ha-ha-ha. What a foolish boy.

44
00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:39.971
Looks like another tip for us, huh, partner?"

45
00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:41.631
one said to the other.

46
00:02:41.651 --> 00:02:44.312
"No, you don't understand.

47
00:02:44.752 --> 00:02:45.992
I did nothing wrong!

48
00:02:46.413 --> 00:02:50.274
Please! Help me find my gold," Pinocchio said.

49
00:02:50.294 --> 00:02:55.235
"Nope, you are stuck here for the rest of your life!"

50
00:02:57.036 --> 00:02:58.176
the jailer said, laughing.

51
00:02:59.584 --> 00:03:03.507
Pinocchio didn't know that the fox and cat owned this town.

52
00:03:04.128 --> 00:03:07.090
They paid the jailers for locking up people they had robbed.

53
00:03:07.931 --> 00:03:11.574
The police had become very rich because of the fox and cat.

54
00:03:13.055 --> 00:03:14.956
Pinocchio sat in prison all day.

55
00:03:15.377 --> 00:03:16.358
But he didn't cry.

56
00:03:16.998 --> 00:03:20.001
He looked out at the stars and said, "Mr.

57
00:03:20.101 --> 00:03:21.081
Cricket is right.

58
00:03:21.642 --> 00:03:23.363
I have been a foolish boy.

59
00:03:23.383 --> 00:03:25.805
I have made bad choices.

60
00:03:26.726 --> 00:03:28.828
It is my fault the gold is gone.

61
00:03:30.864 --> 00:03:32.866
If only someone would save me.

62
00:03:33.506 --> 00:03:36.048
I know I will be a good boy from now on.

63
00:03:36.889 --> 00:03:38.970
Please, is anyone listening?

64
00:03:39.771 --> 00:03:40.691
I need help."

65
00:03:45.355 --> 00:03:47.676
I am listening," said a pretty voice.

66
00:03:48.377 --> 00:03:52.400
Just then, Pinocchio saw a small blue light fly by his window.

67
00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.321
"Who is out there?"

68
00:03:54.341 --> 00:03:55.202
he asked.

69
00:03:55.222 --> 00:03:57.684
"I am the Blue Fairy.

70
00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.841
I protect good children from harm.

71
00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:03.221
I am here to help you."

72
00:04:04.782 --> 00:04:08.423
"Please, get me out of jail," said Pinocchio.

73
00:04:08.443 --> 00:04:11.164
"Why are you in jail?"

74
00:04:11.644 --> 00:04:12.384
asked the fairy.

75
00:04:13.244 --> 00:04:14.524
"What have you done wrong?"

76
00:04:14.544 --> 00:04:18.005
"Nothing at all," said Pinocchio.

77
00:04:18.025 --> 00:04:21.006
"The fox and the cat tricked me.

78
00:04:22.007 --> 00:04:24.207
They stole all my gold coins."

79
00:04:25.487 --> 00:04:26.948
"Where did you get the money?"

80
00:04:27.856 --> 00:04:28.816
asked the Blue Fairy.

81
00:04:28.836 --> 00:04:32.077
"I earned it," said Pinocchio.

82
00:04:32.097 --> 00:04:34.258
"I starred in a show."

83
00:04:35.078 --> 00:04:37.219
Pinocchio's nose suddenly started to grow.

84
00:04:38.099 --> 00:04:40.720
Within seconds, it was six inches long!

85
00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:43.481
Pinocchio stared at his nose in surprise.

86
00:04:45.661 --> 00:04:51.423
Calmly, the Blue Fairy asked, "Did your father say you could work in the theater?"

87
00:04:51.443 --> 00:04:55.464
"Oh yes, Blue Fairy," said Pinocchio.

88
00:04:56.304 --> 00:04:58.986
"My father told me I would be a great actor!"

89
00:05:00.327 --> 00:05:02.889
His nose grew even longer at this new lie.

90
00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:07.412
Soon, Pinocchio's nose was eight inches long!

91
00:05:08.493 --> 00:05:10.334
"What's happening to my nose?"

92
00:05:11.295 --> 00:05:12.396
Pinocchio screamed.
